    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Measuring the Security of Mobile <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span> under Adversarial Prompts from Untrusted Third-Party Channels
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Du%2C+C">Chenghao Du</a>, 
      
