        Simulating and Experimenting with Social Media Mobilization <span class="search-hit mathjax">Using</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">LLM</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agents</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Shirani%2C+S">Sadegh Shirani</a>, 
      
