    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        The Geometry of Dialogue: Graphing Language Models to Reveal Synergistic Teams for Multi-<span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Collaboration
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Furuya%2C+K">Kotaro Furuya</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Kitagawa%2C+Y">Yuichi Kitagawa</a>
      
