        SCRIBE: Structured Chain Reasoning for Interactive Behaviour Explanations <span class="search-hit mathjax">using</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Tool</span> <span class="search-hit mathjax">Calling</span>
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
