    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        Who Grants the <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> Power? Defending Against Instruction Injection via Task-Centric Access Control
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Cai%2C+Y">Yifeng Cai</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Wang%2C+Z">Ziming Wang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Deng%2C+Z">Zhaomeng Deng</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Yao%2C+M">Mengyu Yao</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Liu%2C+J">Junlin Liu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hu%2C+Y">Yutao Hu</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Zhang%2C+Z">Ziqi Zhang</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Guo%2C+Y">Yao Guo</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+D">Ding Li</a>
      
