    <p class="title is-5 mathjax">
      
        OracleAgent: A Multimodal Reasoning <span class="search-hit mathjax">Agent</span> for Oracle Bone Script Research
      
    </p>
    <p class="authors">
      <span class="has-text-black-bis has-text-weight-semibold">Authors:</span>
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Li%2C+C">Caoshuo Li</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Ding%2C+Z">Zengmao Ding</a>, 
      
      <a href="/search/?searchtype=author&amp;query=Hu%2C+X">Xiaobin Hu</a>, 
      
